00:20:25.530 --> 00:20:26.370
Please!

00:20:30.330 --> 00:20:32.370
Okay, I'll think about it.

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:33.420
Okay.

00:20:39.670 --> 00:20:41.510
Trade! Trade!

00:20:42.340 --> 00:20:42.880
Thank you, bear.

00:20:42.880 --> 00:20:43.510
The captain really set him off.

00:20:43.510 --> 00:20:45.550
Thank you, April!

00:20:45.550 --> 00:20:48.510
You're a bad girl, captain.
Wa-hoo! You're welcome, San-Daime!

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:56.350
I don't see Marika.

00:20:56.350 --> 00:20:59.270
She quietly slipped away to the Bentenmaru.

00:21:02.900 --> 00:21:05.660
Let me help again, okay?

00:21:06.780 --> 00:21:10.240
Gruier, don't go off alone.

00:21:13.080 --> 00:21:15.500
Next time you go pirating with Miss Marika,

00:21:15.840 --> 00:21:17.170
